<title>UK: Shield Diagnostics continues rise on AFT.</title>
<headline>Shield Diagnostics continues rise on AFT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Shield Diagnostics were among London's biggest gainers on continued positive sentiment for the company's new heart disease diagnostic drug.</p>
<p>The shares were up 70-1/2p or 13 percent by 0945 GMT after adding 113p on Friday.</p>
<p>Shield said last week that preliminary test results supported the use of Associated Factor 12 (AFT) as a risk predictor for cardiovascular disease.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
